 Seamless Connectivity and Entertainment with Spectrum Internet , Mobile, TV and Voice products.","zh":"我們是一家領先的寬頻連接公司，透過我們的 Spectrum 品牌為 41 個州的 5800 萬個家庭和小型到大型企業提供服務。我們成立於 1993 年，從提供有線電視發展到串流媒體，從高速網路發展到融合寬頻、WiFi 和行動體驗。透過 Spectrum 光纖寬頻網路，並得到 100% 美國員工的支持，我們透過 Spectrum 互聯網、行動、電視和語音產品提供無縫連接和娛樂。"},{"en":"Our strategy is focused on utilizing our fiber-powered network to deliver high-quality, competitively priced products, with outstanding service, allowing us to increase both the number of customers we serve over our network and the number of products we sell to each customer. This combination also reduces the number of service transactions we perform per relationship, yielding higher customer satisfaction and lower customer churn, which results in lower costs to acquire and serve customers and drives greater profitability.","zh":"我們的策略重點是利用我們的光纖網路提供高品質、價格具有競爭力的產品和出色的服務，使我們能夠增加透過網路服務的客戶數量以及向每個客戶銷售的產品數量。這種組合還減少了我們為每個關係執行的服務交易數量，從而提高了客戶滿意度並降低了客戶流失率，從而降低了獲取和服務客戶的成本並提高了盈利能力。"},{"en":"We offer Spectrum Internet products with speeds up to 1 gigabits per second (\"Gbps\") across our entire footprint and multi-gigabit speeds in a portion of our footprint. We continue to upgrade our connectivity network, and we will offer symmetrical and multi-gigabit Internet speeds across our entire footprint in the next several years. Advanced WiFi, a managed WiFi service that provides customers an optimized home network while providing greater control of connected devices with enhanced security and privacy, is available to all of our Internet customers. Spectrum Mobile is available to all new and existing Spectrum Internet customers and offers plans that include 5G access, do not require contracts and include taxes and fees in the price. We continue to innovate our video product and have transformed all of our affiliation agreements with major programmers. These new agreements give us g","zh":"我們提供的 Spectrum 網路產品在整個覆蓋範圍內速度高達每秒 1 吉比特 (“Gbps”)，在部分覆蓋範圍內提供數千兆位元速度。我們將繼續升級我們的連接網路，並在未來幾年內在我們的整個業務範圍內提供對稱的多千兆互聯網速度。高級 WiFi 是一種託管 WiFi 服務，可為客戶提供優化的家庭網路，同時提供對連接設備的更好控制以及增強的安全性和隱私性，我們所有的互聯網客戶均可使用。 Spectrum Mobile 可供所有新的和現有的 Spectrum Internet 客戶使用，並提供包含 5G 接入、不需要合約且價格中包含稅費的套餐。我們繼續創新我們的視訊產品，並改變了我們與主要程式設計師的所有從屬協議。這些新協議給了我們g"}],"markets":[{"en":"We offer Spectrum Internet products with speeds up to 1 gigabits per second (\"Gbps\") across our entire footprint and multi-gigabit speeds in a portion of our footprint. We continue to upgrade our connectivity network, and we will offer symmetrical and multi-gigabit Internet speeds across our entire footprint in the next several years. Advanced WiFi, a managed WiFi service that provides customers an optimized home network while providing greater control of connected devices with enhanced security and privacy, is available to all of our Internet customers. Spectrum Mobile is available to all new and existing Spectrum Internet customers and offers plans that include 5G access, do not require contracts and include taxes and fees in the price. We continue to innovate our video product and have transformed all of our affiliation agreements with major programmers. These new agreements give us g","zh":"我們提供的 Spectrum 網路產品在整個覆蓋範圍內速度高達每秒 1 吉比特 (“Gbps”)，在部分覆蓋範圍內提供數千兆位元速度。我們將繼續升級我們的連接網路，並在未來幾年內在我們的整個業務範圍內提供對稱的多千兆互聯網速度。高級 WiFi 是一種託管 WiFi 服務，可為客戶提供優化的家庭網路，同時提供對連接設備的更好控制以及增強的安全性和隱私性，我們所有的互聯網客戶均可使用。 Spectrum Mobile 可供所有新的和現有的 Spectrum Internet 客戶使用，並提供包含 5G 接入、不需要合約且價格中包含稅費的套餐。我們繼續創新我們的視訊產品，並改變了我們與主要程式設計師的所有從屬協議。這些新協議給了我們g"},{"en":"Our fully deployed fiber-powered network offers ubiquitous and seamless connectivity products. It removes barriers and creates opportunities for customers, in every aspect of their lives. Our brand platform, Life Unlimited , emphasizes the power of our advanced network and cutting-edge connectivity products and services, and our simplified pricing strategy better utilizes our seamless connectivity and entertainment products to offer lower promotional and persistent bundled pricing to drive growth. Additionally, our customer commitments focus on reliable connectivity, transparency, exceptional service and always improving. Through reliable connectivity, we are committed to keeping our customers connected 100% of the time and promptly resolving issues. Transparency at every step means we provide clear and simple pricing and timely service updates, and we take responsibility when things go ","zh":"我們全面部署的光纖供電網路提供無所不在的無縫連接產品。它消除了客戶生活各個方面的障礙並創造了機會。我們的品牌平台 Life Unlimited 強調我們先進網路和尖端連接產品和服務的力量，我們簡化的定價策略更好地利用我們的無縫連接和娛樂產品，提供更低的促銷和持續的捆綁定價，以推動成長。此外，我們的客戶承諾專注於可靠的連接、透明度、卓越的服務和不斷改進。透過可靠的連接，我們致力於讓客戶保持 100% 的連接時間並及時解決問題。每一步的透明度意味著我們提供清晰簡單的定價和及時的服務更新，當事情發生時我們承擔責任"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our fully deployed fiber-powered network offers ubiquitous and seamless connectivity products. It removes barriers and creates opportunities for customers, in every aspect of their lives. Our brand platform, Life Unlimited , emphasizes the power of our advanced network and cutting-edge connectivity products and services, and our simplified pricing strategy better utilizes our seamless connectivity and entertainment products to offer lower promotional and persistent bundled pricing to drive growth. Additionally, our customer commitments focus on reliable connectivity, transparency, exceptional service and always improving. Through reliable connectivity, we are committed to keeping our customers connected 100% of the time and promptly resolving issues. Transparency at every step means we provide clear and simple pricing and timely service updates, and we take responsibility when things go ","zh":"我們全面部署的光纖供電網路提供無所不在的無縫連接產品。它消除了客戶生活各個方面的障礙並創造了機會。我們的品牌平台 Life Unlimited 強調我們先進網路和尖端連接產品和服務的力量，我們簡化的定價策略更好地利用我們的無縫連接和娛樂產品，提供更低的促銷和持續的捆綁定價，以推動成長。此外，我們的客戶承諾專注於可靠的連接、透明度、卓越的服務和不斷改進。透過可靠的連接，我們致力於讓客戶保持 100% 的連接時間並及時解決問題。每一步的透明度意味著我們提供清晰簡單的定價和及時的服務更新，當事情發生時我們承擔責任"}],"competition":[{"en":"We face intense competition for residential customers, both from existing competitors and, as a result of the rapid development of new technologies, services and products, from new entrants.","zh":"我們面臨住宅客戶的激烈競爭，既有來自現有競爭對手的競爭，也有來自新進業者的新技術、服務和產品快速發展的結果。"},{"en":"Our residential Internet service faces competition across our footprint from fiber-to-the-home (\"FTTH\"), fixed wireless broadband, Internet delivered via satellite and DSL services.","zh":"我們的住宅網路服務面臨來自光纖到府（「FTTH」）、固定無線寬頻、透過衛星提供的網路和 DSL 服務的競爭。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Residential Product Line","val":42580000000,"zh":"住宅產品線"},{"name":"Connectivity","val":27527000000,"zh":"連接性"},{"name":"Residential Internet Product Line","val":23765000000,"zh":"住宅網路產品線"},{"name":"Residential Video Product Line","val":13703000000,"zh":"住宅視訊產品線"},{"name":"Commercial Product Line","val":7315000000,"zh":"商業產品線"},{"name":"Commercial Smalland Medium Business Product Line","val":4346000000,"zh":"商業中小企業產品線"},{"name":"Residential Mobile Service Product Line","val":3762000000,"zh":"住宅移動服務產品線"},{"name":"Other Services","val":3411000000,"zh":"其他服務"},{"name":"Commercial Enterprise Product Line","val":2969000000,"zh":"商業企業產品線"},{"name":"Advertisingsales","val":1468000000,"zh":"廣告銷售"}],"total":54774000000}},"peers":["CMCSA","TMUS","MCO","DVA","VRSN"]}}